# D: benchmark
# PHP 8.6.0RC2, clamp(): native
# opcache: off, JIT: off

## 5,000,000 calls each, best of 9 rounds
                             total ms   ns/call    net ns
loop only, no clamping           68.7      13.7         -
clamp()                         160.9      32.2      18.4
inline max(min())               152.0      30.4      16.7
inline ternary                  104.2      20.8       7.1
helper function (ternary)       229.7      45.9      32.2
helper function (min/max)       238.1      47.6      33.9

every clamping variant returned the same sum: true
